{"id":"forecast-11","section":2,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-11/audio-2.mp3","model":"small","duration":408.5,"segments":[{"start":0.56,"end":7.9,"text":"Part 2. You will hear part of a radio programme in which a successful businessman is advising","words":[["Part",0.56,1.08],["2.",1.08,1.52],["You",2.36,2.88],["will",2.88,3.04],["hear",3.04,3.26],["part",3.26,3.58],["of",3.58,3.78],["a",3.78,3.9],["radio",3.9,4.2],["programme",4.2,4.82],["in",4.82,5.48],["which",5.48,5.64],["a",5.64,5.8],["successful",5.8,6.34],["businessman",6.34,7.02],["is",7.02,7.42],["advising",7.42,7.9]]},{"start":7.9,"end":15.14,"text":"listeners on how to become a self-made millionaire. First you have some time to look at questions","words":[["listeners",7.9,8.5],["on",8.5,9.14],["how",9.14,9.34],["to",9.34,9.44],["become",9.44,9.78],["a",9.78,10.1],["self",10.1,10.36],["-made",10.36,10.8],["millionaire.",10.8,11.46],["First",12.68,13.32],["you",13.32,13.56],["have",13.56,13.72],["some",13.72,13.9],["time",13.9,14.3],["to",14.3,14.54],["look",14.54,14.68],["at",14.68,14.82],["questions",14.82,15.14]]},{"start":15.14,"end":66.16,"text":"11 to 16. Now listen carefully and answer questions 11 to 16.","words":[["11",15.14,15.74],["to",15.74,15.98],["16.",15.98,16.5],["Now",62.32,62.64],["listen",62.64,62.96],["carefully",62.96,63.44],["and",63.44,63.84],["answer",63.84,64.26],["questions",64.26,64.74],["11",64.74,65.36],["to",65.36,65.62],["16.",65.62,66.16]]},{"start":69.71,"end":76.67,"text":"Everybody dreams of becoming a millionaire one day. So we asked Arthur Knowles who made","words":[["Everybody",69.71,70.39],["dreams",70.39,70.91],["of",70.91,71.27],["becoming",71.27,71.69],["a",71.69,71.99],["millionaire",71.99,72.55],["one",72.55,72.99],["day.",72.99,73.37],["So",74.09,74.49],["we",74.49,74.77],["asked",74.77,75.21],["Arthur",75.21,75.59],["Knowles",75.59,76.11],["who",76.11,76.39],["made",76.39,76.67]]},{"start":76.67,"end":82.05,"text":"his millions in the plumbing business to give the budding entrepreneurs among you a few","words":[["his",76.67,76.97],["millions",76.97,77.37],["in",77.37,77.63],["the",77.63,77.77],["plumbing",77.77,78.07],["business",78.07,78.59],["to",78.59,79.27],["give",79.27,79.47],["the",79.47,79.65],["budding",79.65,80.13],["entrepreneurs",80.13,80.79],["among",80.79,81.19],["you",81.19,81.49],["a",81.49,81.75],["few",81.75,82.05]]},{"start":82.05,"end":87.27,"text":"tips on how to make your first million. Arthur, welcome to the programme.","words":[["tips",82.05,82.39],["on",82.39,82.69],["how",82.69,82.89],["to",82.89,83.05],["make",83.05,83.29],["your",83.29,83.73],["first",83.73,84.31],["million.",84.31,84.77],["Arthur,",85.39,85.73],["welcome",86.29,86.57],["to",86.57,86.79],["the",86.79,86.87],["programme.",86.87,87.27]]},{"start":87.63,"end":88.17,"text":"Thanks, Sue.","words":[["Thanks,",87.63,87.93],["Sue.",88.05,88.17]]},{"start":88.67,"end":91.99,"text":"So, Arthur, what advice do you have for our listeners?","words":[["So,",88.67,89.11],["Arthur,",89.21,89.53],["what",90.05,90.31],["advice",90.31,90.67],["do",90.67,90.91],["you",90.91,90.99],["have",90.99,91.21],["for",91.21,91.45],["our",91.45,91.63],["listeners?",91.63,91.99]]},{"start":92.63,"end":96.75,"text":"Well, one thing I've heard people say is that when you're starting up a business,","words":[["Well,",92.63,92.93],["one",92.95,93.15],["thing",93.15,93.43],["I've",93.43,93.89],["heard",93.89,94.01],["people",94.01,94.29],["say",94.29,94.71],["is",94.71,95.03],["that",95.03,95.19],["when",95.19,95.37],["you're",95.37,95.65],["starting",95.65,96.01],["up",96.01,96.25],["a",96.25,96.37],["business,",96.37,96.75]]},{"start":97.07,"end":103.23,"text":"you can't afford to make mistakes. Well, I believe in the old saying, a person who","words":[["you",97.07,97.35],["can't",97.35,97.73],["afford",97.73,97.99],["to",97.99,98.19],["make",98.19,98.41],["mistakes.",98.41,98.91],["Well,",99.77,100.21],["I",100.55,100.85],["believe",100.85,101.17],["in",101.17,101.41],["the",101.41,101.51],["old",101.51,101.77],["saying,",101.77,102.11],["a",102.43,102.51],["person",102.51,102.93],["who",102.93,103.23]]},{"start":103.23,"end":105.59,"text":"who never made a mistake, never made anything.","words":[["who",103.23,103.33],["never",103.33,103.55],["made",103.55,103.83],["a",103.83,103.93],["mistake,",103.93,104.29],["never",104.63,104.83],["made",104.83,105.17],["anything.",105.17,105.59]]},{"start":106.63,"end":110.67,"text":"You can't really predict when you'll make mistakes, and you have to look at them as","words":[["You",106.63,106.77],["can't",106.77,107.03],["really",107.03,107.23],["predict",107.23,107.67],["when",107.67,108.03],["you'll",108.03,108.23],["make",108.23,108.41],["mistakes,",108.41,108.87],["and",109.09,109.39],["you",109.39,109.55],["have",109.55,109.69],["to",109.69,109.85],["look",109.85,110.07],["at",110.07,110.23],["them",110.23,110.43],["as",110.43,110.67]]},{"start":110.67,"end":115.29,"text":"a positive experience, and one that means you won't make the same mistake again.","words":[["a",110.67,110.81],["positive",110.81,111.17],["experience,",111.17,111.99],["and",112.45,112.73],["one",112.73,112.91],["that",112.91,113.11],["means",113.11,113.35],["you",113.35,113.61],["won't",113.61,113.91],["make",113.91,114.15],["the",114.15,114.33],["same",114.33,114.59],["mistake",114.59,114.95],["again.",114.95,115.29]]},{"start":116.33,"end":119.03,"text":"You need to be able to cope with the world of business.","words":[["You",116.33,116.65],["need",116.65,116.79],["to",116.79,116.97],["be",116.97,117.07],["able",117.07,117.25],["to",117.25,117.43],["cope",117.43,117.77],["with",117.77,118.05],["the",118.05,118.21],["world",118.21,118.49],["of",118.49,118.63],["business.",118.63,119.03]]},{"start":119.65,"end":124.81,"text":"But according to recent American Business School studies, believing in yourself isn't","words":[["But",119.65,119.81],["according",119.81,120.15],["to",120.15,120.39],["recent",120.39,120.75],["American",120.75,121.13],["Business",121.13,121.65],["School",121.65,122.11],["studies,",122.11,122.57],["believing",123.33,123.63],["in",123.63,123.95],["yourself",123.95,124.33],["isn't",124.33,124.81]]},{"start":124.81,"end":127.27,"text":"enough by itself to guarantee success.","words":[["enough",124.81,125.13],["by",125.13,125.41],["itself",125.41,125.93],["to",125.93,126.19],["guarantee",126.19,126.57],["success.",126.57,127.27]]},{"start":127.27,"end":134.51,"text":"Yes, confidence can be a good thing, but a person can have too much confidence, and people","words":[["Yes,",127.27,127.49],["confidence",128.11,128.67],["can",128.67,129.35],["be",129.35,129.51],["a",129.51,129.63],["good",129.63,129.83],["thing,",129.83,130.21],["but",130.57,130.83],["a",130.83,130.95],["person",130.95,131.29],["can",131.29,131.55],["have",131.55,131.83],["too",131.83,132.15],["much",132.15,132.65],["confidence,",132.65,133.21],["and",133.95,134.21],["people",134.21,134.51]]},{"start":134.51,"end":140.45,"text":"who try to learn to be confident by buying those how to succeed books are just wasting","words":[["who",134.51,134.69],["try",134.69,134.95],["to",134.95,135.13],["learn",135.13,135.51],["to",135.51,135.77],["be",135.77,135.91],["confident",135.91,136.35],["by",136.35,136.69],["buying",136.69,137.49],["those",137.49,137.79],["how",137.79,138.15],["to",138.15,138.29],["succeed",138.29,138.83],["books",138.83,139.27],["are",139.27,139.91],["just",139.91,140.07],["wasting",140.07,140.45]]},{"start":140.45,"end":147.31,"text":"their time. The advice given in these American studies was that being a successful entrepreneur","words":[["their",140.45,140.77],["time.",140.77,141.21],["The",142.05,142.31],["advice",142.31,142.69],["given",142.69,142.95],["in",142.95,143.15],["these",143.15,143.33],["American",143.33,143.77],["studies",143.77,144.33],["was",144.33,145.09],["that",145.09,145.33],["being",145.33,145.67],["a",145.67,146.09],["successful",146.09,146.55],["entrepreneur",146.55,147.31]]},{"start":147.87,"end":153.83,"text":"comes down to having the right attitude. It's no good getting depressed every time","words":[["comes",147.87,148.21],["down",148.21,148.55],["to",148.55,148.71],["having",148.71,149.03],["the",149.03,149.39],["right",149.39,149.73],["attitude.",149.73,150.39],["It's",151.13,151.47],["no",151.47,151.63],["good",151.63,151.91],["getting",151.91,152.39],["depressed",152.39,153.05],["every",153.05,153.53],["time",153.53,153.83]]},{"start":153.83,"end":160.39,"text":"something goes wrong. Always keep your goals in mind and never give up. And don't listen","words":[["something",153.83,154.13],["goes",154.13,154.57],["wrong.",154.57,154.99],["Always",155.63,156.09],["keep",156.09,156.35],["your",156.35,156.57],["goals",156.57,157.03],["in",157.03,157.31],["mind",157.31,157.69],["and",157.69,157.91],["never",157.91,158.23],["give",158.23,158.43],["up.",158.43,158.69],["And",159.13,159.55],["don't",159.55,160.03],["listen",160.03,160.39]]},{"start":160.39,"end":164.89,"text":"to all the people around you who say, oh, this will never work.","words":[["to",160.39,160.63],["all",160.63,160.81],["the",160.81,160.93],["people",160.93,161.25],["around",161.25,161.69],["you",161.69,162.11],["who",162.11,162.57],["say,",162.57,162.81],["oh,",162.95,163.37],["this",163.51,163.77],["will",163.77,163.99],["never",163.99,164.29],["work.",164.29,164.89]]},{"start":166.21,"end":170.77,"text":"One thing I've learned in business is that you don't have to be an expert in everything.","words":[["One",166.21,166.49],["thing",166.49,166.71],["I've",166.71,167.01],["learned",167.01,167.23],["in",167.23,167.43],["business",167.43,167.81],["is",167.81,168.37],["that",168.37,168.51],["you",168.51,168.63],["don't",168.63,168.91],["have",168.91,169.11],["to",169.11,169.27],["be",169.27,169.43],["an",169.43,169.55],["expert",169.55,170.03],["in",170.03,170.39],["everything.",170.39,170.77]]},{"start":171.19,"end":176.53,"text":"Like marketing, for example. When I started my business, I tried to do it all myself.","words":[["Like",171.19,171.43],["marketing,",171.43,171.93],["for",172.13,172.25],["example.",172.25,172.67],["When",173.43,173.69],["I",173.69,173.85],["started",173.85,174.17],["my",174.17,174.43],["business,",174.43,174.79],["I",174.89,175.01],["tried",175.01,175.29],["to",175.29,175.49],["do",175.49,175.65],["it",175.65,175.77],["all",175.77,175.93],["myself.",175.93,176.53]]},{"start":177.01,"end":181.17,"text":"But I soon realised that although I knew everything there was to know about plumbing,","words":[["But",177.01,177.29],["I",177.29,177.41],["soon",177.41,177.63],["realised",177.63,178.03],["that",178.03,178.27],["although",178.27,178.65],["I",178.65,178.97],["knew",178.97,179.13],["everything",179.13,179.65],["there",179.65,179.91],["was",179.91,180.07],["to",180.07,180.25],["know",180.25,180.47],["about",180.47,180.75],["plumbing,",180.75,181.17]]},{"start":181.17,"end":184.99,"text":"I didn't have much idea about how to sell my ideas.","words":[["I",181.17,181.95],["didn't",181.95,182.17],["have",182.17,182.33],["much",182.33,182.63],["idea",182.63,183.03],["about",183.03,183.39],["how",183.39,183.73],["to",183.73,183.91],["sell",183.91,184.25],["my",184.25,184.51],["ideas.",184.51,184.99]]},{"start":185.49,"end":191.09,"text":"So I got someone who knew more about this to take care of the marketing side of things","words":[["So",185.49,185.85],["I",185.85,186.45],["got",186.45,186.59],["someone",186.59,186.93],["who",186.93,187.33],["knew",187.33,187.53],["more",187.53,187.91],["about",187.91,188.13],["this",188.13,188.49],["to",188.49,188.89],["take",188.89,189.07],["care",189.07,189.49],["of",189.49,189.79],["the",189.79,189.93],["marketing",189.93,190.29],["side",190.29,190.75],["of",190.75,190.87],["things",190.87,191.09]]},{"start":191.09,"end":191.67,"text":"for me.","words":[["for",191.09,191.45],["me.",191.45,191.67]]},{"start":191.89,"end":197.49,"text":"Then as for leadership, well, you've got to be someone your workers look up to because","words":[["Then",191.89,192.31],["as",192.31,192.45],["for",192.45,192.65],["leadership,",192.65,193.09],["well,",193.73,194.37],["you've",194.73,194.95],["got",194.95,195.09],["to",195.09,195.23],["be",195.23,195.35],["someone",195.35,195.69],["your",195.69,195.95],["workers",195.95,196.35],["look",196.35,196.59],["up",196.59,196.87],["to",196.87,197.13],["because",197.13,197.49]]},{"start":197.49,"end":200.15,"text":"you've been seen to make the right decisions.","words":[["you've",197.49,198.17],["been",198.17,198.49],["seen",198.49,198.93],["to",198.93,199.17],["make",199.17,199.35],["the",199.35,199.51],["right",199.51,199.69],["decisions.",199.69,200.15]]},{"start":200.69,"end":205.41,"text":"You have to be able to control people but listen to them at the same time.","words":[["You",200.69,201.09],["have",201.09,201.29],["to",201.29,201.41],["be",201.41,201.53],["able",201.53,201.73],["to",201.73,201.89],["control",201.89,202.33],["people",202.33,202.85],["but",202.85,203.35],["listen",203.35,204.07],["to",204.07,204.41],["them",204.41,204.59],["at",204.59,204.69],["the",204.69,204.77],["same",204.77,205.05],["time.",205.05,205.41]]},{"start":205.41,"end":211.89,"text":"same. Some people are driven to make their companies successful, but that too often leads","words":[["same.",205.41,205.47],["Some",206.11,206.55],["people",206.55,206.95],["are",206.95,207.45],["driven",207.45,207.91],["to",207.91,208.19],["make",208.19,208.39],["their",208.39,208.57],["companies",208.57,208.97],["successful,",208.97,209.65],["but",209.81,209.95],["that",209.95,210.77],["too",210.77,211.03],["often",211.03,211.41],["leads",211.41,211.89]]},{"start":211.89,"end":213.37,"text":"to a ruthless approach.","words":[["to",211.89,212.19],["a",212.19,212.35],["ruthless",212.35,212.81],["approach.",212.81,213.37]]},{"start":214.51,"end":221.87,"text":"Then there's the question of taking risks, even calculated ones. I personally feel it's","words":[["Then",214.51,214.95],["there's",214.95,215.23],["the",215.23,215.35],["question",215.35,215.67],["of",215.67,215.93],["taking",215.93,216.43],["risks,",216.43,216.91],["even",217.21,217.59],["calculated",217.59,218.29],["ones.",218.29,218.83],["I",219.61,219.95],["personally",219.95,220.47],["feel",220.47,220.89],["it's",220.89,221.87]]},{"start":221.87,"end":227.25,"text":"actually better to tread carefully when it comes to taking short-term risks. You need","words":[["actually",221.87,222.17],["better",222.17,222.49],["to",222.49,222.71],["tread",222.71,223.13],["carefully",223.13,223.79],["when",223.79,224.07],["it",224.07,224.19],["comes",224.19,224.43],["to",224.43,224.67],["taking",224.67,225.01],["short",225.01,225.53],["-term",225.53,225.81],["risks.",225.81,226.27],["You",226.79,227.01],["need",227.01,227.25]]},{"start":227.25,"end":232.53,"text":"a degree of vision, certainly, but it's easy to get carried away by your desire","words":[["a",227.25,227.69],["degree",227.69,227.97],["of",227.97,228.25],["vision,",228.25,228.61],["certainly,",228.77,229.21],["but",229.73,229.97],["it's",229.97,230.19],["easy",230.19,230.47],["to",230.47,230.65],["get",230.65,230.81],["carried",230.81,231.21],["away",231.21,231.59],["by",231.59,231.79],["your",231.79,232.05],["desire",232.05,232.53]]},{"start":232.53,"end":238.73,"text":"to increase profits. And if things go wrong, you can end up losing more than you gain.","words":[["to",232.53,232.79],["increase",232.79,233.33],["profits.",233.33,233.93],["And",234.67,234.85],["if",234.85,234.97],["things",234.97,235.25],["go",235.25,235.63],["wrong,",235.63,236.19],["you",236.53,236.69],["can",236.69,236.85],["end",236.85,237.09],["up",237.09,237.27],["losing",237.27,237.69],["more",237.69,238.09],["than",238.09,238.27],["you",238.27,238.43],["gain.",238.43,238.73]]},{"start":242.47,"end":248.07,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the programme, you have some time to look at questions 17","words":[["Before",242.47,242.79],["you",242.79,243.03],["hear",243.03,243.31],["the",243.31,243.49],["rest",243.49,243.75],["of",243.75,243.87],["the",243.87,243.97],["programme,",243.97,244.49],["you",245.13,245.45],["have",245.45,245.63],["some",245.63,245.83],["time",245.83,246.23],["to",246.23,246.47],["look",246.47,246.59],["at",246.59,246.75],["questions",246.75,247.01],["17",247.01,248.07]]},{"start":248.07,"end":272.55,"text":"to 20. Now listen and answer questions 17 to 20.","words":[["to",248.07,248.31],["20.",248.31,248.73],["Now",269.05,269.37],["listen",269.37,269.71],["and",269.71,270.05],["answer",270.05,270.49],["questions",270.49,270.91],["17",270.91,271.87],["to",271.87,272.15],["20.",272.15,272.55]]},{"start":275.84,"end":280.4,"text":"So if you have a great idea for a business, what should you do next?","words":[["So",275.84,276.4],["if",276.4,276.84],["you",276.84,276.96],["have",276.96,277.08],["a",277.08,277.2],["great",277.2,277.46],["idea",277.46,278.08],["for",278.08,278.28],["a",278.28,278.4],["business,",278.4,278.66],["what",279.26,279.52],["should",279.52,279.7],["you",279.7,279.86],["do",279.86,280.02],["next?",280.02,280.4]]},{"start":281.06,"end":286.58,"text":"Well, the first thing to ask yourself is whether there's a need for your product or service.","words":[["Well,",281.06,281.36],["the",281.68,281.84],["first",281.84,282.12],["thing",282.12,282.36],["to",282.36,282.54],["ask",282.54,282.8],["yourself",282.8,283.14],["is",283.14,283.82],["whether",283.82,284.16],["there's",284.16,284.5],["a",284.5,284.6],["need",284.6,284.94],["for",284.94,285.24],["your",285.24,285.42],["product",285.42,285.8],["or",285.8,286.08],["service.",286.08,286.58]]},{"start":286.58,"end":292.42,"text":"companies. Can you cater for people's needs better than existing companies? You don't","words":[["companies.",286.58,286.7],["Can",287.24,287.48],["you",287.48,287.74],["cater",287.74,288.12],["for",288.12,288.4],["people's",288.4,288.9],["needs"