",311.66,311.86],["life",311.86,312.22],["to",312.22,312.42],["it?",312.42,312.6],["Because",312.88,313.26],["realistically",313.26,314.04]]},{"start":314.04,"end":319.74,"text":"that's how long it will take. Tell us how you got started Arthur. How do you","words":[["that's",314.04,314.66],["how",314.66,314.82],["long",314.82,315.12],["it",315.12,315.26],["will",315.26,315.42],["take.",315.42,315.86],["Tell",316.3,316.64],["us",316.64,316.84],["how",316.84,317.02],["you",317.02,317.14],["got",317.14,317.34],["started",317.34,318.06],["Arthur.",318.06,318.44],["How",318.98,319.54],["do",319.54,319.64],["you",319.64,319.74]]},{"start":319.74,"end":325.3,"text":"explain your early success? Well I started my business just as the economy was","words":[["explain",319.74,320.18],["your",320.18,320.44],["early",320.44,320.82],["success?",320.82,321.26],["Well",322.22,322.24],["I",322.24,322.44],["started",322.44,322.9],["my",322.9,323.18],["business",323.18,323.66],["just",323.66,324.08],["as",324.08,324.38],["the",324.38,324.54],["economy",324.54,324.98],["was",324.98,325.3]]},{"start":325.3,"end":329.82,"text":"going into a recession, which wasn't the best time and I was lucky to survive,","words":[["going",325.3,325.52],["into",325.52,325.8],["a",325.8,325.94],["recession,",325.94,326.36],["which",326.9,327.12],["wasn't",327.12,327.44],["the",327.44,327.56],["best",327.56,327.9],["time",327.9,328.28],["and",328.28,328.68],["I",328.68,328.8],["was",328.8,328.9],["lucky",328.9,329.22],["to",329.22,329.4],["survive,",329.4,329.82]]},{"start":330.24,"end":334.08,"text":"especially as the banks weren't being particularly supportive to small","words":[["especially",330.24,330.64],["as",330.64,330.9],["the",330.9,331.04],["banks",331.04,331.52],["weren't",331.52,331.84],["being",331.84,332.04],["particularly",332.04,332.56],["supportive",332.56,333.42],["to",333.42,333.7],["small",333.7,334.08]]},{"start":334.08,"end":338.2,"text":"businesses at that time. If I'd listened to the business advice I was","words":[["businesses",334.08,334.62],["at",334.62,334.84],["that",334.84,335.02],["time.",335.02,335.42],["If",336.3,336.42],["I'd",336.42,336.62],["listened",336.62,336.78],["to",336.78,336.96],["the",336.96,337.06],["business",337.06,337.38],["advice",337.38,337.9],["I",337.9,338.06],["was",338.06,338.2]]},{"start":338.2,"end":342.94,"text":"given back then, I'd never have got started. My strengths were that I","words":[["given",338.2,338.4],["back",338.4,338.64],["then,",338.64,339.0],["I'd",339.48,339.76],["never",339.76,339.96],["have",339.96,340.12],["got",340.12,340.28],["started.",340.28,340.86],["My",341.52,341.76],["strengths",341.76,342.26],["were",342.26,342.6],["that",342.6,342.8],["I",342.8,342.94]]},{"start":342.94,"end":348.58,"text":"I knew I could provide a better service than my competitors, who really hadn't spotted","words":[["I",342.94,343.0],["knew",343.0,343.24],["I",343.24,343.66],["could",343.66,343.86],["provide",343.86,344.32],["a",344.32,344.62],["better",344.62,344.98],["service",344.98,345.5],["than",345.5,345.74],["my",345.74,345.98],["competitors,",345.98,346.54],["who",347.1,347.3],["really",347.3,347.78],["hadn't",347.78,348.2],["spotted",348.2,348.58]]},{"start":348.58,"end":353.62,"text":"the opportunities that were out there, and that my wife had a good job and was able to","words":[["the",348.58,348.84],["opportunities",348.84,349.42],["that",349.42,349.78],["were",349.78,349.92],["out",349.92,350.16],["there,",350.16,350.46],["and",350.86,351.26],["that",351.26,351.44],["my",351.44,351.58],["wife",351.58,351.92],["had",351.92,352.24],["a",352.24,352.38],["good",352.38,352.54],["job",352.54,352.88],["and",352.88,353.06],["was",353.06,353.2],["able",353.2,353.42],["to",353.42,353.62]]},{"start":353.62,"end":358.8,"text":"pay the household bills while I was getting the company on its feet. The first couple","words":[["pay",353.62,353.84],["the",353.84,354.02],["household",354.02,354.48],["bills",354.48,3